WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.192
Shop mein naya collection hai, par logon

00:00:03.192 --> 00:00:06.024
ko pata nahi? Chaliye, ek local boutique

00:00:06.024 --> 00:00:07.773
ka campaign banate hain.

00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:10.978
Pehle ek offer chunte hain. Phir shop mein

00:00:10.978 --> 00:00:13.761
product shoot karte hain, taaki video ke

00:00:13.761 --> 00:00:17.199
pehle kuch seconds mein hi collection dikh jaaye.

00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:20.506
Customer Reel scroll kar raha hai. Beech

00:00:20.506 --> 00:00:23.473
mein aapki shop ka sponsored ad aata hai.

00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:26.877
Pasand aaya? Tap karke website khol sakta hai.

00:00:27.217 --> 00:00:30.193
YouTube par yahi product ek alag video ad

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:33.083
mein dikhta hai. Campaign ki setting ke

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:36.322
hisaab se ad main video se pehle aa sakta hai.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:39.487
Jo log Google par search karte hain, unke

00:00:39.487 --> 00:00:42.146
liye Search Ads aur SEO kaam aate hain.

00:00:42.146 --> 00:00:45.220
Phir clicks aur enquiries dekhkar campaign

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.383
sudhaarte hain.

00:00:46.723 --> 00:00:49.449
Apni shop ka ad chalana hai? Neeche

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:52.927
contact karein. Offer, location aur budget

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.525
se shuruat karenge.
